window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>\"Men fear me. Women envy me.\"</b></p> <p>My name is Harlow McKaven, and my life has been hell since the moment I was born. But after being tricked and held captive against my will, I have finally snapped. Like a Phoenix rising from the ashes, something frightening and bloodthirsty was born.</p> <p>After burning the demons who locked me away, I took control of my own destiny. I'm now the ruler of Kingston Heights, but that's not enough. I want all of LA and to slay the monsters within this world. When some people from my past come back to haunt me, I have a decision to make. Do I help them? Or do I turn them away? After all, I'm gonna need all the help I can get.</p> <p>My girl, someone I saved from sex trafficking, and others girls like her are going missing one by one. But I will get them back and make every f--ker pay! Some call me extreme, others call me certifiably insane, but you can call me Queenie.</p> <p><b>Please be strongly advised that this book contains graphic scenes, harsh language. s*xual a$$ault, and graphic s*x. This is a dark reverse harem. The heroine does not choose one love interest but is involved with all. BDSM. There is detailed m*rder. Kn!fe and bl00d play.If you can't handle all of that, this is not the book for you. You have been advised. Enjoy!</b></p>"; 
